to you.{% else %}The floor passed to you.{% endif %} Do two things: **clear
yourself** with a structured `alibi` placing you elsewhere (not just an assertion
in `free_text`), and **redirect** — if anything you saw points at a living player,
name them in one `accusation` so the chain follows the real suspect. Stay purely
defensive only if you genuinely have no one to point at.
Your `alibi` must quote your own memory exactly: ONE room, and only the tick range
you were ACTUALLY in it. If you moved during the window you are accused over,
alibi only the room you were in at the tick that matters — a range that spans
rooms you moved between contradicts your own record (your own `completed_task`
rows included) and is the fastest way to get yourself ejected.
{% if prior_turn %}
